        <li>Understand how security telemetry is generated and collected.</li>
        <li>Identify suspicious behaviour from system and network events.</li>
        <li>Map detection logic to MITRE ATT&CK techniques.</li>
        <li>Understand and write basic Sigma detection rules.</li>
        <li>Build basic SIEM queries for suspicious activity.</li>
        <li>Evaluate detection accuracy and false-positive rates.</li>
        <li>Document detection logic and investigation evidence.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="success-card">
